    "body": "- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\nProvide option to show configurable line numbers for the\r\nactive/focused file window in `windows.line_numbers`\r\n- `windows.line_numbers.enabled` boolean\r\n- `windows.line_numbers.relative` boolean, whether line numbers are in the style of the `relativenumber` option\r\n\r\nI tried to assess where this would best fit in, as in some places I tried there was an ugly one draw delay before the numbers appeared. Hope this is good\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecd2b62c-b36a-4e60-b08b-6ea782ae34b4\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-03-12T15:41:34Z",
