    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi Aristosis, \r\n\r\nI think it is already possible to set those options in the 'MiniFilesWindowUpdate' event.\r\n\r\nIn my config the linenumber options are set as follows:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n\r\n local restrict_linenumbers = function(args) -- add linenumbers only to active window\r\n    local win_id = vim.api.nvim_get_current_win()\r\n    if win_id and win_id == args.data.win_id then\r\n      vim.wo[win_id].relativenumber = true\r\n      vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('WinLeave', {\r\n        once = true,\r\n        callback = function() vim.wo[win_id].relativenumber = false end,\r\n      })\r\n    end\r\n  end\r\n  Config.new_autocmd('User', 'MiniFilesWindowUpdate', restrict_linenumbers, 'Restrict linenumbers')\r\n\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2026-03-12T15:31:07Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/pull/2312#issuecomment-4047712926",
