            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I do occasionally see the flicker, but it is by far not frequent. Here is the demo in which I don't think I've seen a flicker even once:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d9cbad6-2575-4738-bf33-193559dbc6d8\r\n\r\nThe presence of flicker probably has to do with machine being either fast or slow (not sure what is the case here).\r\n\r\nBut in any case, I am afraid the config from this PR is still too much to add.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere is a very vague plan to refactor 'mini.files' to allow any layout, in which case this kind of change should be more robust to add. But the plan hasn't crystallized yet, unfortunately.",
